  "notes": [
    "This is a curated, current-scope geography snapshot rather than a complete lore gazetteer.",
    "The hierarchy is encoded with parent_source_key and related_source_keys in module-owned data; the shared SQLite entity type remains region.",
    "The set covers a world, a macroregion, a mobile base, two playable regions, fourteen mapped subregions, six outposts, and selected client-attested facilities, interiors, landmarks, routes, shelters, and anomalous zones.",
    "Official English, Simplified Chinese, and Vietnamese values were selected independently from aligned client localization; one language never substitutes for another.",
    "Hán-Việt names are generated, unofficial dictionary readings. Contextual readings are selected only from alternatives returned by the dictionary.",
    "thumbnail_source_url is a community presentation reference when populated, not first-party naming evidence and not a bundled asset.",
    "Main Pillar Office is conservatively parented only to Wuling because the client data does not establish a more precise mapped parent.",
    "OMV Dijiang is related to Talos-II rather than treated as geographically contained by it because it is a mobile orbital base."
